# Summon: Shiva ({3}{U}{U}) is cast on turn 3 with Black Lotus's {U}{U}{U} and Mox Pearl and Mox Jet. As it enters it gets a lore counter (CR 714.3a): chapter I taps Bot2's
# Ornithopter and puts a stun counter on it (Bot1's own Elvish Mystic is no legal target). After Bot1's draw on turn 5 it gets another: chapter II does the same to Bot2's
# Memnite. On turn 6 Bot2's Ornithopter untaps (its stun counter went in the turn-4 untap step), the Memnite stays tapped (its counter goes now), and Bot2 taps its
# Llanowar Elves for mana. Chapter III on turn 7 draws a card for each tapped creature Bot2 controls: Memnite and Llanowar Elves, two; the untapped Ornithopter does not
# count, nor does Bot1's own Elvish Mystic, tapped for mana while the chapter is on the stack. It is then sacrificed (CR 714.4).

